    <briefdescription>
<para>Unit tests for GPUStreamManager CudaStreamBackendFn bridge (STUB #77). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Verifies that the CudaStreamBackendFn injection works correctly in non-CUDA builds (THEMIS_ENABLE_CUDA not defined): GSM-CB-01 No fn set → ROCm/CPU fallback used; stream created. GSM-CB-02 Fn returns BackendFn → stream created with injected backend. GSM-CB-03 Fn throws exception → fall back to ROCm/CPU (fail-safe).</para>
<para>Tests run in builds WITHOUT THEMIS_ENABLE_CUDA. In CUDA builds the injected fn is never reached and the tests are skipped. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
